---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-sub">滋賀・草津の完全プライベート空間</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      心と体がほどける、<br />
      極上のオイルトリートメント
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-text">
      日常の慌ただしさを忘れ、深い安らぎへと導く女性専用サロン。<br />
      熟練の手技と上質なオイルで、至福のひとときをお届けします。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-action">
      <button type="button" class="hero-btn js-open-booking">
        空き状況の確認・ご予約はこちら
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 65vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(45, 36, 32, 0.55), rgba(45, 36, 32, 0.55)),
      #443831; /* 画像設定前のアーストーン背景 */
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: #ebdcd0;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .hero-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    color: #f2ebe4;
  }

  .hero-action {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero-btn {
    background-color: #9c7a59;
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    padding: 1.1rem 2.75rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    transition: background-color 0.25s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .hero-btn:hover {
    background-color: #886847;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .sp-only {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-section {
      min-height: 55vh;
      padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .hero-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .sp-only {
      display: inline;
    }
    .hero-btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
